## Quick checklist for agents

**Fish ≠ Bash**

- [ ] `set` / `set -gx` / `set -U` — not `VAR=` or `export`
- [ ] `$status` — not `$?`
- [ ] `test` / `string` / `math` — not `[[ ]]`, `$(( ))`
- [ ] Redirects: `2>/dev/null` (or project-consistent form)
- [ ] Lists: `fish_add_path`, `contains`, `string split` — not Bash PATH strings
- [ ] `(command)` substitution — not backticks; no `${var}`
- [ ] Reassign locals: `set x`, not `set -l x` inside nested blocks
- [ ] Optional positionals: `-` sentinel, not `""`
- [ ] `functions/name.fish` defines `function name` only at top level
- [ ] `fish -n` on all modified `.fish` files

**TideReport**

- [ ] GitHub tests reset session context globals when asserting zero subprocesses
- [ ] CI/cache fixtures use actual branch after `git init`
- [ ] CLI tests redirect stdout when checking exit codes
- [ ] New footgun this session → entry added above (rule to make rules)
